--- web: a signal stops serve(), and its pages leave; the program goes on
web: serving at http://127.0.0.1:PORT/
web: stopping (interrupted)
ready
the page leaves
serve() returned: HTTP/1.1 200 OK, 0 pages
[exit 0]
--- web: another signal, once serve() has returned, ends the program
web: serving at http://127.0.0.1:PORT/
web: stopping (interrupted)
ready
the page leaves
serve() returned: HTTP/1.1 200 OK, 0 pages
[exit 143]
--- web: a second signal while the pages leave ends the program
web: serving at http://127.0.0.1:PORT/
web: stopping (interrupted)
ready
the page leaves
[exit 143]
